{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22257","headline":"自秦望赴五松驿马上偶睡睡觉成吟 · 白居易","name":"自秦望赴五松驿马上偶睡睡觉成吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长途发已久，前馆行未至。\n体倦目已昏，瞌然遂成睡。\n右袂尚垂鞭，左手暂委辔。\n忽觉问仆夫，才行百步地。\n形神分处所，迟速相乖异。\n马上几多时，梦中无限事。\n诚哉达人语，百龄同一寐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}